# Media control: requests are only accepted for sources with the CONTROLLABLE_MEDIA flag whose plug-in implements
# the callback; they are queued and executed in order at the next video tick, each followed by a signal
# (set_time has none).  started/ended signal immediately.  Queries call the plug-in directly.
kind med input video,controllable media
kind plain input video media
create m med M
create p plain P
watch m
watch p
media m play
media m pause
media m restart
media m stop
media m next
media m prev
media m settime 5000
media m query
tick m 0.01
media m query
media p play
media p query
media m started
media m ended
media p started
